Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.18.69-rt75 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.18.69 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.18-rt
  Head SHA1: 13d0cf9acf33c1862917e36c306ffd77bb4e3d1b


Or to build 3.18.69-rt75 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.18.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.18.69.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.18/patch-3.18.69-rt75.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
